<details class="boot-intro about">
    <summary>About Beydle</summary>
    <p>Beydle is a free daily guessing game for <strong>Beyblade X</strong> blades, in the style of Wordle. One blade is chosen every day at midnight (Europe/Berlin) and everyone gets the same one.</p>
    <h2>How to play</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Type the name of a Beyblade X blade and submit your guess. Takara Tomy and Hasbro names both work.</li>
        <li>Each guess shows how it compares with the hidden blade: type, spin direction, weight, product line, stock ratchet and bit, release year and anime owner. A counter shows how many blades still fit your hints.</li>
        <li>Green means a match, yellow means close, and arrows tell you whether the hidden blade's value is higher or lower.</li>
        <li>Guesses are unlimited. Solving the blade unlocks round 2, where you identify a second blade from a silhouette that sharpens with every wrong guess.</li>
        <li>Xtreme mode makes every guess fit all the hints you have so far.</li>
        <li>Your streak and statistics are stored in your browser. Practice mode lets you play random blades without affecting them.</li>
    </ul>
</details>
